# Prisma
# migration_lock.toml is deliberately NOT ignored: Prisma writes "it should be
# added in your version-control system" inside the file itself. It records which
# database provider the migrations were written for, and without it a checkout
# has no way to catch someone pointing the same migrations at a different engine.

